Subject: [PATCH 1004/1004] SableOS: Files letter keys and the hint dock

* FilesActivity runs the new single-letter commands: J / K are sent
  on as Down / Up, T opens Recent, V switches grid and list
  (BaseActivity.toggleViewMode, the view menu's path), E runs the
  selection menu's Share through runKeyboardAction like the others.
* Hint dock (FILES_DOCUMENTS_UX artifact, Files home): a bar at the
  bottom of the Files window with the focused file (name, type, size,
  date), a "/ Search files..." prompt that opens search, and the key
  line "Enter Open, J/K Move, T Latest, E Export, O Open with, ...".
  It is added to the coordinator layout of both the classic and the
  Material 3 layouts, and the Files layout keeps its full height
  above it. The picker is unchanged.
